  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP MR-st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r transition Jemen 2012-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Transitional support Human Rights Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xE4;rka arbetet f&#xF6;r de m&#xE4;nskliga             r&#xE4;ttigheterna under transitionsperioden i Jemen, genom att st&#xF6;dja     etableringen av en oberoende nationell m&#xE4;nskliga                      r&#xE4;ttigheters-institution, utveckla civila samh&#xE4;llets kapacitet att    arbeta med m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter, och st&#xF6;dja ministeriet f&#xF6;r          M&#xE4;nskliga R&#xE4;ttigheter f&#xF6;r att effektivt kunna bidra till</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the strengthening of Human Rights during  the Transition Period in Yemen through the establishment of an        independent National Human Rights Body; the development of Civil      Society Capacities in Human Rights; and support to the Ministry of    Human Rights to effectively contribute to the transitional process.</narrative>
  </description>
